 /// Abstract view of a bounded LRU cache.
 ///
 /// - `contents`: the key-value mapping of all cached entries.
 /// - `capacity`: maximum number of entries.
 /// - `lru_order`: keys ordered from LRU (index 0) to MRU (last element).
 #[verifier::ext_equal]
